WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.000
Clutch friction disc
What it does: Transfers or couples engine torque to the five-speed manual transmission.

2
00:00:04.000 --> 00:00:08.000
Clutch friction disc
How it works: The pressure plate clamps the disc against the flywheel.

3
00:00:08.000 --> 00:00:12.000
Clutch friction disc
How it moves: Turns with the flywheel when the clutch is engaged. It can turn at a different speed when disengaged; the engaged state is shown here.
